%% Sequence Diagram for Parent-Managed Youth Account APIs
sequenceDiagram
  participant Parent as Parent/Guardian (Web/Mobile UI)
  participant APIGW as API Gateway
  participant YouthS as Youth Service
  participant SettingsS as Settings Service
  participant TxnS as Transaction Service Proxy
  participant DB as Youth DB
  participant CoreBank as Core Banking
  participant Auth as OAuth Service
  participant Notification as Notification Service

  Note over Parent,APIGW: All API calls secured by OAuth2/JWT, RBAC enforced

  Parent->>APIGW: GET /api/youth-accounts/{id}/dashboard (JWT)
  APIGW->>Auth: Validate JWT/OAuth2
  APIGW->>YouthS: Forward request
  YouthS->>DB: Fetch youth account, limits
  YouthS->>TxnS: GET transaction summary
  TxnS->>CoreBank: GET transactions
  YouthS->>APIGW: Aggregate dashboard response
  APIGW->>Parent: Return dashboard JSON

  Parent->>APIGW: POST /api/youth-accounts/{id}/fund-transfer
  APIGW->>Auth: Validate JWT/OAuth2
  APIGW->>YouthS: Forward transfer request
  YouthS->>CoreBank: POST fund transfer
  YouthS->>DB: Update balance
  YouthS->>Notification: Send alert
  YouthS->>APIGW: Return transfer result
  APIGW->>Parent: Transfer status

  Parent->>APIGW: PUT /api/youth-accounts/{id}/spending-limit
  APIGW->>Auth: Validate JWT/OAuth2
  APIGW->>YouthS: Forward limit update
  YouthS->>SettingsS: Update spending limit
  SettingsS->>DB: Persist new limit
  SettingsS->>YouthS: Confirm update
  YouthS->>APIGW: Return status
  APIGW->>Parent: Limit update confirmation

  Parent->>APIGW: GET /api/youth-accounts/{id}/transactions
  APIGW->>Auth: Validate JWT/OAuth2
  APIGW->>YouthS: Forward request
  YouthS->>TxnS: Fetch transactions
  TxnS->>CoreBank: Proxy transaction query
  YouthS->>APIGW: Return transaction list
  APIGW->>Parent: Return transactions